    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=616 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Mithrall: A World Carved by Legend and Iron</h2>Enter the realm of Mithrall, an open-world MMO that fuses the freedom of sandbox crafting with the thrill of survival. Embark on a journey where the legacy of dwarves is in your hands, and every sunset could end in glory or peril.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><strong>Tranquil Beginnings:</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/63a43fd3e65591025c076ee9b7e09e54.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/63a43fd3e65591025c076ee9b7e09e54.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/63a43fd3e65591025c076ee9b7e09e54.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Begin your saga within the peaceful confines of a dwarven city, a place where the rhythm of the anvil's beat is a testament to prosperity and calm.<br><br><strong>The Call of the Horizon:</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/faa2e324f6556b4b2938f0f390ef456a.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/faa2e324f6556b4b2938f0f390ef456a.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/faa2e324f6556b4b2938f0f390ef456a.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gaze upon the vast world that awaits, a canvas for your ambition, filled with distant mysteries shrouded in mist and guarded by dragons.<br><br><strong>Artisanal Mastery:</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/2ebf9a5b04f60afefc51fe12b9831baa.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/2ebf9a5b04f60afefc51fe12b9831baa.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/2ebf9a5b04f60afefc51fe12b9831baa.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Ascend from humble beginnings to become a master of the forge, where every ingot smelted and sword tempered marks another step towards greatness.<br><br><strong>A Tapestry of Servers:</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d6a68581b2ea3647fc9aa74e4a5f2604.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d6a68581b2ea3647fc9aa74e4a5f2604.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d6a68581b2ea3647fc9aa74e4a5f2604.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore the seamless integration of realms through server meshing technology, creating an uninterrupted continuum for thousands of concurrent souls.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Season-Based World </h2>Witness the evolution of Mithrall with seasons that bring not only a renewed landscape but also new lore, events, and challenges that test the mettle of every dwarf.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reputation is Everything</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/47ed7bade658d76b19b7d081703373eb.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/47ed7bade658d76b19b7d081703373eb.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/47ed7bade658d76b19b7d081703373eb.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your actions carry weight, forging your reputation across the lands. Will you be known as a daring explorer, a shrewd merchant, or a solitary wanderer? Your story, your renown.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Wilds Await</h2>Engage in a rich PVE experience, facing off against the creatures of myth and legend, mining the depths for riches, or discovering secrets lost to time.<br><br>Forge your destiny in the fires of Mithrall, where every strike of the hammer, every strategic alliance, and every battle waged is a verse in the song of your legend. Your journey commences now.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=616 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/a797a247fa66735bd2bc951bdaf200b5.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Mithrall: A World Carved by Legend and Iron</h2>Enter the realm of Mithrall, an open-world MMO that fuses the freedom of sandbox crafting with the thrill of survival. Embark on a journey where the legacy of dwarves is in your hands, and every sunset could end in glory or peril.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><strong>Tranquil Beginnings:</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/63a43fd3e65591025c076ee9b7e09e54.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/63a43fd3e65591025c076ee9b7e09e54.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/63a43fd3e65591025c076ee9b7e09e54.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Begin your saga within the peaceful confines of a dwarven city, a place where the rhythm of the anvil's beat is a testament to prosperity and calm.<br><br><strong>The Call of the Horizon:</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/faa2e324f6556b4b2938f0f390ef456a.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/faa2e324f6556b4b2938f0f390ef456a.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/faa2e324f6556b4b2938f0f390ef456a.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gaze upon the vast world that awaits, a canvas for your ambition, filled with distant mysteries shrouded in mist and guarded by dragons.<br><br><strong>Artisanal Mastery:</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/2ebf9a5b04f60afefc51fe12b9831baa.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/2ebf9a5b04f60afefc51fe12b9831baa.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/2ebf9a5b04f60afefc51fe12b9831baa.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Ascend from humble beginnings to become a master of the forge, where every ingot smelted and sword tempered marks another step towards greatness.<br><br><strong>A Tapestry of Servers:</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d6a68581b2ea3647fc9aa74e4a5f2604.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d6a68581b2ea3647fc9aa74e4a5f2604.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/d6a68581b2ea3647fc9aa74e4a5f2604.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore the seamless integration of realms through server meshing technology, creating an uninterrupted continuum for thousands of concurrent souls.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Season-Based World </h2>Witness the evolution of Mithrall with seasons that bring not only a renewed landscape but also new lore, events, and challenges that test the mettle of every dwarf.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reputation is Everything</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/47ed7bade658d76b19b7d081703373eb.poster.avif?t=1743621568\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/47ed7bade658d76b19b7d081703373eb.webm?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838890/extras/47ed7bade658d76b19b7d081703373eb.mp4?t=1743621568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your actions carry weight, forging your reputation across the lands. Will you be known as a daring explorer, a shrewd merchant, or a solitary wanderer? Your story, your renown.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Wilds Await</h2>Engage in a rich PVE experience, facing off against the creatures of myth and legend, mining the depths for riches, or discovering secrets lost to time.<br><br>Forge your destiny in the fires of Mithrall, where every strike of the hammer, every strategic alliance, and every battle waged is a verse in the song of your legend. Your journey commences now.",
